      "author_solution_sha256": "c0c631c593b7d7021d235d59d4bb3d6d3bdc203212cfa6486f9a29db22b77258",
      "author_solution": "711. Task: six floors of positive/negative irrational roots.\nsqrt(2) floors 1 and -sqrt(2) floors -2;\nsqrt(13) floors 3 and -sqrt(13) floors -4;\nsqrt(47) floors 6 and -sqrt(47) floors -7.\nNegating a noninteger does not negate its floor.",
      "independent_authority_reused": {
