      "author_solution_sha256": "fd6e0fd34ce369461516cb71f3cb3cd4b3b7bbc9ae4de507bd5776c17e057a42",
      "author_solution": "714. Task: two full solution sets.\na 2<=2.75+x<3 =>[-.75,.25).\nb equality of fractional parts iff inputs differ by an integer =>x in Z.\nUnbounded integer lattice is not a single interval.",
