      "evidence": "The transformation, final responses and endpoint/domain distinctions match the already frozen independent solution. No new source solve was performed. q718-sum-counterexamples/A: floor(1.2)=1 versus floor(.6)+floor(.6)=0. q718-sum-counterexamples/B: floor(-.5)=-1 versus floor(-.2)+floor(-.3)=-2. q718-sum-counterexamples/D: floor(2)=2 versus floor(1.7)+floor(.3)=1; exact carry also breaks equality. Reviewed every permitted view and all its options for this source (1 question). The source universal floor-sum question becomes explicit refuting-pair selection. Negative summands and exact carry threshold are included; equality examples remain."
    },
